    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778880/extras/504f11e1d15f6a28c71f1d13d4f2dae8.webp?t=1754749724\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sword of Shadow: Revolution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> is an urban planning simulator with elements of survival, the action takes place on planet earth on a piece of once warm country, but after the disaster everything became completely different ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have to take on the role of commander of the settlement and begin to rebuild a new city, village, towns, cope with the shortage your people have food, because the cold does not spare anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778880/extras/6582eef737f0829ce4babe670a3a3c63.webp?t=1754749724\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Technology Branch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Various variations of buildings and structures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Various emotions and conditions of the townspeople</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Create clothes and other items </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Improve the quality of life through the development of citizens</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Train and equip them for protection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Construction system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build structures on a piece of land to expand your settlement, improve people's buildings to support life and remember - the cold does not spare anyone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create a new future with Sword of Shadow: Revolution.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778880/extras/504f11e1d15f6a28c71f1d13d4f2dae8.webp?t=1754749724\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sword of Shadow: Revolution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> is an urban planning simulator with elements of survival, the action takes place on planet earth on a piece of once warm country, but after the disaster everything became completely different ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have to take on the role of commander of the settlement and begin to rebuild a new city, village, towns, cope with the shortage your people have food, because the cold does not spare anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778880/extras/6582eef737f0829ce4babe670a3a3c63.webp?t=1754749724\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Technology Branch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Various variations of buildings and structures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Various emotions and conditions of the townspeople</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Create clothes and other items </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Improve the quality of life through the development of citizens</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Train and equip them for protection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Construction system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build structures on a piece of land to expand your settlement, improve people's buildings to support life and remember - the cold does not spare anyone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create a new future with Sword of Shadow: Revolution.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
